02:22:24.925 --> 02:22:25.805
<v SPEAKER_6>Genau, dann reden wir nochmal wieder.

02:22:29.445 --> 02:22:29.865
<v SPEAKER_2>Tschüss.

02:22:34.945 --> 02:22:37.125
<v SPEAKER_4>Thank you for coming and we'll see you soon.
